---
title: AET Plan-Task Lifecycle (v1.9.0)
---
flowchart LR
    subgraph Authoring [Authoring]
        A1[Human/Agent writes plan]
        A2[docs/plans/&lt;id&gt;.md]
    end

    A1 --> A2

    subgraph Intake [Intake]
        I1[aet sprint add]
        I2[Extract portable spec]
        I3[Create task record]
    end

    A2 --> I1
    I1 --> I2
    I2 --> I3

    subgraph Queue [Live Queue]
        Q1[refs/aet/tasks/&lt;id&gt;]
        Q2[Plan file becomes gitignored working copy]
    end

    I3 --> Q1
    A2 -.->|transient copy| Q2

    subgraph Run [Run Start]
        R1[aet run-one]
        R2[Render plan into worktree]
        R3[.worktrees/&lt;id&gt;/docs/plans/&lt;id&gt;.md]
    end

    Q1 --> R1
    R1 --> R2
    R2 --> R3

    subgraph Work [Implementation]
        W1[Agent reads/writes plan]
        W2[Commits implementation]
    end

    R3 --> W1
    W1 --> W2

    subgraph Close [Terminal Closure]
        C1[aet ship close]
        C2[Seal task record]
        C3[Archive plan to docs/plans/archive/]
        C4[Append to work-history.jsonl]
    end

    W2 --> C1
    C1 --> C2
    C1 --> C3
    C1 --> C4
    C2 --> Q1

    style Authoring fill:#e1f5e1
    style Intake fill:#fff4e1
    style Queue fill:#e1f0ff
    style Run fill:#f0e1ff
    style Work fill:#ffe1e1
    style Close fill:#e1e1e1
